Package: uk.551.no2theft.smslocationfix
Name: No2Theft SMS GPS Location Fix (Experimental)
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: 551UK
Author: 551UK
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), xyz.cypwn.no2theft16 (>= 1.3.5)
Description: Experimental iOS 16 SMS GPS fix for No2Theft Enhanced.
 Corrects 0,0 Maps links from wrong-passcode alerts and IP-derived London Maps links from remote-command SMS using the existing on-demand GPS helper.
 Installs separately from the stable tweak and retains the original SMS recipient numbers.
